  "subject": "a father whose hand now shakes asking you to write the new year couplets",
  "caption": "Cantonese art song in the Western lied tradition. Solo piano only, played with rubato and sustained pedalling, through-composed rather than verse-chorus, the accompaniment shadowing and commenting on the voice. Intimate recital-room sound with natural decay and no beat at all. Trained male baritone singing in a classical art-song style, with the melody shaped so that every Cantonese lexical tone is respected, unhurried and precise. 64 BPM with rubato, B flat major. Inheriting a brush. No drums, no bass, no strings, no pop production, no key change.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n年廿八 阿爸攤開紅紙 磨墨\n每年佢都寫「出入平安」「身體健康」\n佢手震咗兩年 字開始歪\n佢話「歪啲先似手寫」\n\n[Chorus]\n今年佢叫我寫\n我拎住支筆 好似拎住一樣好重嘅嘢\n我寫咗「出入平安」 四隻字 寫咗半粒鐘\n佢企喺後面 冇出聲\n\n[Verse]\n我寫得好醜 我知\n佢拎起嚟睇 睇咗好耐\n佢話「得」 一個字\n然後佢親手貼上門口\n\n[Chorus]\n今年佢叫我寫\n我拎住支筆 好似拎住一樣好重嘅嘢\n我寫咗「身體健康」 寫畀佢\n佢企喺後面 我聽到佢深呼吸\n\n[Outro]\n紅紙仲有一張\n佢話 留畀出年",
